{
  "name": "HL·08 Supplier form (n8n side)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL·08 Supplier form: n8n side (lesson 6.4)\nThe form and Zap stay in ZAPIER (Tolu's assistant edits them). The Zap POSTs each submission here with a shared secret header. n8n validates, stores it as pending, and asks Tolu to approve.\nContract: {\"business_name\",\"contact_name\",\"phone\",\"email\",\"products\",\"area\"} + header x-hl-secret.\n\nTable: suppliers(id serial, business_name, contact_name, phone, email, products, area, status, created_at).\n**Credentials:** Postgres (Supabase), Telegram. **Environment:** HL_EDGE_SECRET. **Replace:** YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "f5e10edb-4b4a-4b28-8257-08eb1aa83fc6",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "hl-supplier",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "359c4550-2409-44f6-a20e-0dcbf226fa80",
      "name": "Supplier webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "75f596f2-3056-41b1-83f8-3a6a27b1d1fc"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const j = $input.first().json;\nconst b = j.body || {};\nconst secretOk = !!$env.HL_EDGE_SECRET && (j.headers || {})['x-hl-secret'] === $env.HL_EDGE_SECRET;\nconst s = v => String(v || '').trim().slice(0, 200);\nconst digits = String(b.phone || '').replace(/\\D/g, '').replace(/^(234|0)/, '');\nconst rec = {\n  business_name: s(b.business_name), contact_name: s(b.contact_name),\n  phone: digits.length === 10 ? '+234' + digits : '',\n  email: /^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test(s(b.email)) ? s(b.email).toLowerCase() : '',\n  products: s(b.products), area: s(b.area)\n};\nconst missing = Object.entries(rec).filter(([k, v]) => !v && k !== 'email').map(([k]) => k);\nreturn [{ json: { ...rec, ok: secretOk && missing.length === 0, why: !secretOk ? 'bad secret' : missing.length ? 'missing: ' + missing.join(', ') : 'ok' } }];"
      },
      "id": "92a05a96-d68c-4a68-ad31-615882429e2a",
      "name": "Validate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "7405f057-3110-4fdc-9c4a-090ad1a3fcb8",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c0bb0127-e11d-4345-a35e-b22411df166d",
      "name": "Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "INSERT INTO suppliers (business_name, contact_name, phone, email, products, area, status, created_at)\nVALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5, $6, 'pending', now()) RETURNING id;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.business_name, $json.contact_name, $json.phone, $json.email, $json.products, $json.area ] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "f84b5663-5c50-4f5e-8f8f-6e745ad9c421",
      "name": "Store pending supplier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        660,
        -90
      ]
    },
    {
